   "body": "/claim mac/mac-mbp\n\nOperator go (2026-11-27): captures with the kit account `user1`. Plan (#1315 and #1203, one capture PR if the kit run is shared):\n- #1315: a 4-page MP thread of `user1`: GET `page=2` (and `page=3`), status, redirects, whether the page holds only that page's messages; HFR-PROTOCOL note; check #1314's « Page numéro… » against it.\n- #1203: an existing storage-subject MP that another member sent to `user1`: the MP list row, the thread's first page (the storage search URL), the list again after that GET. Read-only (GET only), no thread deleted.\n- Anonymize per `docs/FIXTURES.md`, independent review (another model) before any push, draft PR.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
